<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/russian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Russian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Russian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Alexander II's Emancipation Edict frees some 23 million privately owned serfs</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-states"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20States.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United States</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Civil War begins after eleven Southern states secede</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/argentine-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Argentine%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Argentine Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Bartolomé Mitre defeats the Confederation at Pavón, reuniting Buenos Aires and the provinces</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-sardinia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Sardinia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Sardinia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Victor Emmanuel II is proclaimed King of Italy in Turin</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-italy"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Italy.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Italy</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Parliament in Turin proclaims Victor Emmanuel II king of Italy</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/circassia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Circassia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Circassia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Circassian delegates meet in a united assembly at Sochi</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/sultanate-of-zanzibar"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Sultanate%20of%20Zanzibar.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Sultanate of Zanzibar</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Canning Award confirms Zanzibar’s separation from Oman</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/bamana-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Bamana%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Bamana Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Umar Tall takes Ségou and makes it the capital of the Toucouleur Empire</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/self-strengthening-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Self-Strengthening%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Self-Strengthening Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Zongli Yamen is created under Prince Gong to conduct relations with the Western powers</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/federation"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Federation.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Federation</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Seceding southern states form the Confederate States of America, and the American Civil War begins</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/principality-of-monaco"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Principality%20of%20Monaco.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Principality of Monaco</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Franco-Monégasque Treaty recognises Monaco's sovereignty; Charles III cedes Menton and Roquebrune to France for 4,100,000 francs.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-the-two-sicilies"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20the%20Two%20Sicilies.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of the Two Sicilies</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Francis II surrenders and abdicates at Gaeta in February; the Two Sicilies are annexed to the Kingdom of Sardinia, proclaimed the Kingdom of Italy.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/confederate-states-of-america"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Confederate%20States%20of%20America.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Confederate States of America</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 8 February delegates at the Montgomery Convention form the Confederate States of America; Jefferson Davis is elected provisional president the next day.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/confederate-states-of-america"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Confederate%20States%20of%20America.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Confederate States of America</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 12 April Confederate forces under Beauregard bombard and take Fort Sumter in Charleston harbour; Lincoln calls up 75,000 militia and Virginia, Arkansas, Tennessee and North Carolina secede.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/taiping-rebellion"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Taiping%20Rebellion.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Taiping Rebellion</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Zeng Guofan’s Xiang Army captures Anqing, helped by a Royal Navy blockade</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/nationalism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Nationalism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Nationalism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Risorgimento unites the states of the Italian peninsula in the Kingdom of Italy</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/jose-rizal"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Jos%C3%A9%20Rizal.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>José Rizal</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">José Rizal is born in Calamba, Laguna</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/queen-victoria"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Queen%20Victoria.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Queen Victoria</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Albert dies of typhoid fever in December, and Victoria withdraws into mourning and seclusion</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-puebla"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Puebla.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Puebla</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">President Benito Juárez imposes a two-year moratorium on loan-interest payments to French, British and Spanish creditors</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-puebla"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Puebla.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Puebla</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A Spanish fleet takes possession of Veracruz, and French and British forces arrive in January</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/saint-petersburg"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Saint%20Petersburg.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Saint Petersburg</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The emancipation of the serfs brings a large influx of former peasants into the capital</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/naples"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Naples.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Naples</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Naples becomes part of the Kingdom of Italy</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/rabindranath-tagore"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rabindranath%20Tagore.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rabindranath Tagore</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Born in the Jorasanko mansion in Calcutta, the youngest of 13 surviving children</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/empress-dowager-cixi"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Empress%20Dowager%20Cixi.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Empress Dowager Cixi</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">After the Xianfeng Emperor's death she and Ci'an oust the eight regents in the Xinyou Coup and begin ruling from behind the curtain</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/unification-of-italy"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Unification%20of%20Italy.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Unification of Italy</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The first Italian Parliament proclaims Victor Emmanuel King of Italy on 17 March</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/underground-railroad"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Underground%20Railroad.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Underground Railroad</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">General Benjamin Butler keeps three men who fled to Fort Monroe, calling them contraband of war</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/utilitarianism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Utilitarianism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Utilitarianism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">John Stuart Mill's Utilitarianism appears as three articles in Fraser's Magazine</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/serer-religion"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Serer%20religion.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Serer religion</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Serers are a target of the jihad led by the Mandinka cleric Ma Ba Jaxoo</span></li></ul></section>
